<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-046" chapter-id="c-songshu-046-zhaoqian-complete" source-id="s-songshu-046-zhaoqian-complete-ws2118581">
  <p id="c-songshu-046-zhaoqian-complete:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhaoqian-complete:p001:m0001" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACAA">倩</persName>，尚文帝第四女海鹽公主。初，<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhaoqian-complete:p001:m0016" ref="3b1_39e_aa6">始興王濬</persName>以潘妃之寵，故得出入後宮，遂與公主私通。及適<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhaoqian-complete:p001:m0042" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACAA">倩</persName>，<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhaoqian-complete:p001:m0044" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACAA">倩</persName>入宮而怒，肆詈搏擊，引絕帳帶。事上聞，有詔離婚，殺主所生<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhaoqian-complete:p001:m0073" ref="znv_mpm_bqm">蔣美人</persName>，</p>
</text>
